This post is only in English, so its Indonesian URL shows this English text with a notice, and search engines are pointed back here.

## Static first

Every page is built ahead of time as plain HTML. JavaScript only ships where something on the page is interactive.

## Content as files

Posts, Photos and Works are files in the repository, edited through the Studio. A single content module reads them, so moving to a database later only changes that module.
